<div class="article articletype-1" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
    
    <div class="header">
        <p>
            <span class="news-list-date">
                <time itemprop="datePublished" datetime="2026-10-29">
                    <small>29 October 2026</small>
                </time>
            </span>
            
                <small><span class="news-list-category"> | Fungi</span></small>
            
        </p>
        <h4 class="title">
            <a itemprop="url" title="Update of rationale document for voriconazole published" href="/fungi-afst/development-of-clinical-breakpoints-and-ecoffs/rationale-documents/">
                
                        <span itemprop="headline">Update of rationale document for voriconazole published</span>
                    
            </a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div class="teaser-text">
        <div class="description" itemprop="description">
            <p>
                
                    
                            <p>The rationale document for voriconazole has been updated and published. The updated version (4.1) includes amendments in section 8 (clinical breakpoints) for clarity and removal of the breakpoints…</p>
                        
                
            </p>
        </div>
        <a title="Update of rationale document for voriconazole published" class="more btn btn-tertiary arrow-circle" href="/fungi-afst/development-of-clinical-breakpoints-and-ecoffs/rationale-documents/">
            <span>Read more</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>


                    
                        



<div class="article articletype-1" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
    
    <div class="header">
        <p>
            <span class="news-list-date">
                <time itemprop="datePublished" datetime="2026-10-28">
                    <small>28 October 2026</small>
                </time>
            </span>
            
                <small><span class="news-list-category"> | VetCast</span></small>
            
        </p>
        <h4 class="title">
            <a itemprop="url" title="Public Consultation of the first VetCAST breakpoint tables" href="/about-eucast/public-consultations/">
                
                        <span itemprop="headline">Public Consultation of the first VetCAST breakpoint tables</span>
                    
            </a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div class="teaser-text">
        <div class="description" itemprop="description">
            <p>
                
                    
                            <p>The first VetCAST breakpoint tables for veterinary bacteria are now available for public consultation. The tables cover the main bacterial species and main host species. Closing date for comments is…</p>
                        
                
            </p>
        </div>
        <a title="Public Consultation of the first VetCAST breakpoint tables" class="more btn btn-tertiary arrow-circle" href="/about-eucast/public-consultations/">
            <span>Read more</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>


                    
                        



<div class="article articletype-1" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
    
    <div class="header">
        <p>
            <span class="news-list-date">
                <time itemprop="datePublished" datetime="2026-10-13">
                    <small>13 October 2026</small>
                </time>
            </span>
            
                <small><span class="news-list-category"> | VetCast</span></small>
            
        </p>
        <h4 class="title">
            <a itemprop="url" title="Oxytetracycline in Cattle Rationale Document published for VetCAST" href="/vetcast/development-of-clinical-breakpoints-and-ecoffs/rationale-documents/">
                
                        <span itemprop="headline">Oxytetracycline in Cattle Rationale Document published for VetCAST</span>
                    
            </a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div class="teaser-text">
        <div class="description" itemprop="description">
            <p>
                
                    
                            <p>The rationale document for oxytetracycline in cattle is now published. This document supports the first version of the VetCAST clinical breakpoint tables which will be published soon.&nbsp;</p>
                        
                
            </p>
        </div>
        <a title="Oxytetracycline in Cattle Rationale Document published for VetCAST" class="more btn btn-tertiary arrow-circle" href="/vetcast/development-of-clinical-breakpoints-and-ecoffs/rationale-documents/">
            <span>Read more</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>


                    
                        



<div class="article articletype-0" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
    
    <div class="header">
        <p>
            <span class="news-list-date">
                <time itemprop="datePublished" datetime="2026-10-07">
                    <small>07 October 2026</small>
                </time>
            </span>
            
                <small><span class="news-list-category"> | Bacteria</span></small>
            
        </p>
        <h4 class="title">
            <a itemprop="url" title="Proposal for paediatric dosages table." href="/news-detail/proposal-for-paediatric-dosages-table/">
                
                        <span itemprop="headline">Proposal for paediatric dosages table.</span>
                    
            </a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div class="teaser-text">
        <div class="description" itemprop="description">
            <p>
                
                    
                            <p>The table proposes dosages which are commonly used in paediatric patients. These dosages are presented in relation to the use of EUCAST breakpoints. Deadline for comments is 27 November 2026.</p>
                        
                
